# The BaseCLF deployment the example page talks to. Point it at the address
# `npx create-baseclf` printed. Copy this file to `.env`; `.env` is gitignored.
#
# The origin this site runs on (http://localhost:3000 for `npm run dev`) has to be
# in the deployment's trusted origins, or the browser's requests fail CORS.
VITE_BASECLF_URL=
